/*
 * Retrieves and merges trait-implementation methods into the class vtable.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - locating all `impl Trait` blocks declared in the class,
 *   - validating the trait reference,
 *   - retrieving all methods declared inside each implementation,
 *   - validating implementation method prototypes,
 *   - merging implementation methods into the class vtable,
 *   - enforcing trait-override rules(no implicit override across traits),
 *   - recording locally implemented traits for final vtable installation.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::class_::method::trait_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/class_/method/trait_.yr
 * @Author(s):
